{"4589570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Space Race", "steam_appid": 4589570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/6c56ed63370cfd8a9562bb8ec2541a40.poster.avif?t=1778270262\" width=1170 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/6c56ed63370cfd8a9562bb8ec2541a40.webm?t=1778270262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/6c56ed63370cfd8a9562bb8ec2541a40.mp4?t=1778270262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>Fly as fast as you can from start to finish without exploding.<br>Controls take place in zero gravity. There is no braking! Here, the laws of inertia apply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/274e106e8a05ae49a1a795298e6f05f6.poster.avif?t=1778270262\" width=1170 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/274e106e8a05ae49a1a795298e6f05f6.webm?t=1778270262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/274e106e8a05ae49a1a795298e6f05f6.mp4?t=1778270262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid obstacles such as black holes, lasers, or other space hazards, such as aliens.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/8e3073468e3349a4b0f0253db61db5a3.poster.avif?t=1778270262\" width=1170 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/8e3073468e3349a4b0f0253db61db5a3.webm?t=1778270262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/8e3073468e3349a4b0f0253db61db5a3.mp4?t=1778270262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collecting Suns</strong><br>In each level, you must collect all suns to unlock the goal. Only once every single sun has been reached can you land at the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lasers and Timing</strong><br>Lasers are obstacles that periodically turn on and off. You must time your movement correctly to pass through safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chasing Rockets</strong><br>In addition, you will be hunted by chasing rockets that relentlessly pursue you. They increase the pressure and force you to keep moving at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aliens and Weight System</strong><br>Aliens can land on your rocket and change its weight and center of mass. This affects the flight behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics and Control</strong><br>The entire control system is based on zero gravity and follows the laws of inertia. There is no classic braking function. The only way to reduce speed is to rotate the rocket 180 degrees and then accelerate in the opposite direction.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/6c56ed63370cfd8a9562bb8ec2541a40.poster.avif?t=1778270262\" width=1170 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/6c56ed63370cfd8a9562bb8ec2541a40.webm?t=1778270262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/6c56ed63370cfd8a9562bb8ec2541a40.mp4?t=1778270262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>Fly as fast as you can from start to finish without exploding.<br>Controls take place in zero gravity. There is no braking! Here, the laws of inertia apply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/274e106e8a05ae49a1a795298e6f05f6.poster.avif?t=1778270262\" width=1170 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/274e106e8a05ae49a1a795298e6f05f6.webm?t=1778270262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/274e106e8a05ae49a1a795298e6f05f6.mp4?t=1778270262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid obstacles such as black holes, lasers, or other space hazards, such as aliens.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/8e3073468e3349a4b0f0253db61db5a3.poster.avif?t=1778270262\" width=1170 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/8e3073468e3349a4b0f0253db61db5a3.webm?t=1778270262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589570/extras/8e3073468e3349a4b0f0253db61db5a3.mp4?t=1778270262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collecting Suns</strong><br>In each level, you must collect all suns to unlock the goal. Only once every single sun has been reached can you land at the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 